# Supabase — the backend behind /admin and the public projects page.
#
# Both values are safe in a browser bundle: the anon key is designed to be
# public and every privilege boundary is enforced by Row Level Security.
# NEVER put the service-role key in this file or anywhere else in the repo.
#
# Get them from https://supabase.com/dashboard → your project → Project Settings
# → API. Leave them unset and the site falls back to the ten projects bundled in
# src/data/projects.ts, and /admin will refuse to sign in.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
